    80	
    81	The ninth he knew by what it took away. At dusk it had lifted, as it lifted every dusk, and he had told it no; and he had heard, for the first time in two years of telling it so, what he was refusing, since every other sound in him had dropped as it came up, as a yard goes quiet under falling snow.
    82	
