editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-006/REPAIR-REPORT-r1.md:5:No file under `books/` or `v3-runs/` was opened; `source-tracking.md` was not opened either, since the brief describes each chain without the source. No git command was run. Chapters 38, 39 and 41–44 were re-read from disk before editing; every change was an individually written replacement of an exact passage, or a scene written out again whole. No protected unit was touched: a count of the same sixty-two exact strings finds each of them once, and the three restored units stand as the coordinator placed them.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-006/REPAIR-REPORT-r1.md:64:Sentences 2,767; median 10. Every chapter is inside 13.3–14.2, at or under 4.5% in the long tail, and inside 850–1,050 words per scene. Chapter 40 grew by the restored unit's joins, the re-entered bark scene and the solitude paragraph; chapters 41 and 43 are shorter by what C removed. By `wc`: 5,438 / 5,144 / 6,154 / 5,131 / 5,232 / 5,146 / 5,352, total 37,597.
