editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-002/review-editorial.md:15:Interest slips only a little after the ford, during the long recovery-and-accounting stretch in chapters 12–13. That material is worthwhile—the injuries change how the group works, and each companion gets a distinct question—but a thirteen-year-old reader may feel the forward plot pause before the well. The well restores immediate physical pressure and gives Cael an excellent, quiet development beat.
