editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-006/plan-audit.stdout.log:17340:+7. **North/Millrace — OWNER after protected restoration.** The northern wicket and later west/south bend are locally plausible (`manuscript/chapter-44.md:213–223,295–301`), but the full protected unit says she will be three days north when the crew returns to the board (`source chapter-16.md:127`). The crew is back at Lowmarch day 112 and Oryn is at Millrace, one day south of Lowmarch, day 113 (`STATE_LEDGER.md:38–40,55`; `packets/MOVEMENT-007.md:26,30`). A road bend cannot reconcile those assertions.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-006/plan-audit.stdout.log:17374:+The three full-source restorations are:
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-006/plan-audit.stdout.log:17378:+- **ch44:105 — Oryn to the assembled five, with the last sentence directed to Cael.** Full unit is source `chapter-16.md:127`. Fix 14 restores it immediately before the already-protected “Don’t go in without me” unit (`manuscript/chapter-44.md:107–109`). Fix 13 removes prose that had independently composed the protected unit’s “morning” and “seventeen at Oxhollow” content (`manuscript/chapter-43.md:161`).
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-006/plan-audit.stdout.log:17380:+The mandatory edition bans require no changes inside any of those units: none contains a named season/month, metric unit, year-since-Kindling count, or obsolete edition name. The source wording is therefore restored without alteration.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-006/plan-audit.stdout.log:17390:+Oryn’s road bend is KEEP as terrain, but it cannot validate the restored protected “three days north”; that remains the owner conflict in §2.7 (`manuscript/chapter-44.md:295–301`; `source chapter-16.md:127`).
