editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-006/recheck-r1.stdout.log:1741:    69	- **ch44:105 — Oryn to the assembled five, with the last sentence directed to Cael.** Full unit is source `chapter-16.md:127`. Fix 14 restores it immediately before the already-protected “Don’t go in without me” unit (`manuscript/chapter-44.md:107–109`). Fix 13 removes prose that had independently composed the protected unit’s “morning” and “seventeen at Oxhollow” content (`manuscript/chapter-43.md:161`).
