editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-007/recheck-r1.md:1:# CLOSE WITH LINE FIXES — seven local replacements
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-007/recheck-r1.md:3:Scope: six local paragraphs in chapters 47–48 must keep the final wrist patient at the bench and restore the source's actual distinction between the refused lean-to request and the granted road request; one chapter 52 sentence must establish that the protected radius figure is read from scaled divisions within the lone line, not as literal spacing along a ten-stride wall. No protected unit is altered, no scene rewrite or second repair is needed, and the settled length is not reopened.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-007/recheck-r1.md:15:I reopened source chapter 20 for all three passages named in `source-tracking.md` and applied the same-content/same-order standard rather than relying on the automatic percentage. All three returned passages are **RESOLVED**. **New tracking: none.** The repaired roof correction, two-visit dating, and wall-work support do not reproduce a new source chain. The overlap command independently reports zero unprotected shared runs of eight or more words.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-007/recheck-r1.md:19:The perimeter supplies the single size/design confirmation. The diff compresses the baseline's repeated “The same size … The both of them” / “To a stride … the same size twice” into “Then they're the one size” and Karis's one answer, “To a stride” (`chapter-52.md:53–57`). Later work produces new findings rather than re-proving the same proposition: forty-one kinds **in the courses** (`52:283–289`), then the separate line **between** the courses (`52:291–301`). The closing log no longer repeats “Karis has the round, and it is the Fallow's.” The one remaining clarity defect is not repeated proof but the impossible literal sound of the protected spacing number; line fix 7 resolves that without touching the protected unit.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-007/recheck-r1.md:46:### Coordinator-applied protected units — PASS
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-007/recheck-r1.md:48:The five restored units are verbatim, each occurs once, and nearby prose does not repeat them: Pike's “Nothing else ever” unit (ch45); Seln's “Take it” council unit (ch46); Oryn's consent/teaching unit, including “Then come here” and the wrist staging (ch48); Oryn's bolt unit (ch49); and Karis's between-the-courses radius unit (ch52). The proposed fixes are all outside those units. Pike's Fallow line remains narrated rather than reprinted, as ruled. No Karis stride length is stated.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-007/recheck-r1.md:62:1. **Chapter 52 radius spacing — AMEND.** The full source unit does not explain the number as a scale, an encoded figure or a sheet interval. Read literally, it says Karis “paced the spacing” of a line recurring on the chamber walls at 220 yards and a stride; that cannot fit a chamber ten strides across. Current `chapter-52.md:251` reinforces the literal reading by making her walk the wall with a cord while “counting.” The protected unit cannot be changed. Line fix 7 therefore establishes outside it that she is reading scaled divisions **within** the lone line, not measuring distance along the wall. That makes the protected figure intelligible without decoding what the line means or why it is there.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-007/recheck-r1.md:63:2. **Oryn's “different question” — AMEND.** The author's location/role reading is not the source's full distinction. At the lean-to, Cael asks permission to touch **the boy's wrist while Oryn works**, in order to feel what she feels; Oryn refuses because the patient did not come to be practised on. On the road, Cael asks to read **Oryn herself**; she is the person under his hand and can consent, and the reading is now a deliberate lesson (surface, then a minute of the long reading). Bench versus rock and tired versus rested are circumstances, not the governing difference. Current chapters 47–48 instead make both requests “may I read you,” contradicting the protected line; the current chapter 47 has also dismissed every patient before the request. Fixes 1–6 leave the last small patient waiting with a wrist injury and restore the different patient, consenter and purpose in fresh wording without changing protected text or creating an unprotected source quotation.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-007/recheck-r1.md:104:Gates: all eight chapters return **reader_standard=0, metadata=0, modern=0**. The gate command reports chapter word counts of ch45 4,403; ch46 6,237; ch47 4,448; ch48 4,703; ch49 4,885; ch50 5,324; ch51 6,544; ch52 5,895.
