editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-007/AUTHORSHIP.md:11:| Coordinator rulings applied | The NO-SOURCE method. The launch rulings for this movement: entry at first light on the 111th at Thornwater with Oryn gone by the northern wicket and her mule with the crew (#24); nineteen; ten fragments; deployment since the Line thirteen at entry; the debt to Oryn owed and not paid; what Oryn knows, and that she does not know Seln to be the source of Shadow-adjacent; Millrace a day south of Lowmarch and Oryn at her table there on the 113th, made true in one plain line and remarked on by nobody (EXC-B7-003); the lean-to request asked first, refused and entered first; *the Quieting* for the box and not for Pike; "the still place" not said and the finding private; Teague's crew and the six on the rim unnamed and the healer of no Path absent; bodies and money as Movement 6 left them. Shadow used once, unseen and never attributable, with the sightline stated on the page; the Anchor unbinding after perception at ten feet, with no measured reach, rate or price; every other capability rule of STATE_LEDGER §2; no companion Path inside the line; the #49 default; faceless; the case untouched; the index and the stroke-and-bar undecoded; the three hundred taken and never paid; Oryn a stop on her route; the #50 default (Seln's line word for word, unglossed, no arithmetic, the case a twelve-year matter in his window); C3 on the morning of the 115th with no stride length for Karis. The coordinator's mid-run note that Movement 6's repair had landed (chapters 43 and 44 were read from disk after it landed, before chapter 45 was written). OWNER-DECISIONS #18, #23, #24, #33, #42, #46, #48, #49, #50, #51. Reader Standard. No new names. |
