53-## 4. Standing defaults
54-
55-- **PASS — calendar vocabulary and measures.** A full scan of chapters 31–37 finds no month name, named season, English weekday, metric unit, or elapsed year-count from Kindling. Generic “season,” “snow,” “harvest,” “frost” and “cold term” are allowed under the standing decision (`OWNER-DECISIONS.md:287-304`). Distances are feet, yards, strides, hands, miles and days (`manuscript/chapter-31.md:9-11,261-265`; `manuscript/chapter-32.md:155,191`).
56-- **PASS — Cael.** He is eighteen during Movement 5 (`manuscript/chapter-34.md:47`), with nineteen reserved for day 102 (`MOVEMENT-006.md:14,29`). “his Path” never appears; his Arbiter is never described as awake or unaffected, and outside protected logs the prose says fragments/what he carries rather than granting him a Path (`manuscript/chapter-31.md:229-235`; `manuscript/chapter-36.md:247`).
57-- **PASS — #49 vocabulary.** “Quieting” is absent; “Compact” is spoken once (`manuscript/chapter-34.md:243`); nothing says why the fragments answer inside; and the site is dated no more closely than “Five years … maybe six” (`manuscript/chapter-34.md:231`).
58-- **PASS — Reader Standard.** The violence is costly and legible without gore, sexual material or profanity: the arm is held, treated and ordered out of use, and Cael's consent violation is named wrong before the act (`manuscript/chapter-31.md:189-235,289-315`; `manuscript/chapter-36.md:67-115,153-177,197-223`).
